[{:adr/consequences "{:api_key_not_provisioned \"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is not yet a Cloudflare Pages secret for\\n                            net-babiniku -- the feature is live in code and deployed, but\\n                            returns the honest 503 in production until the key is added\\n                            (follow-up, alongside the still-open babiniku.net DNS/1Password\\n                            items already tracked this session)\", :real_reply_unverified \"a real successful chat turn against a live key has NOT been verified\\n                          end-to-end -- only the request path (a deliberately invalid key\\n                          reaching a genuine 401 from api.anthropic.com) and every honest-\\n                          default/validation error path were verified. Verifying a real\\n                          successful reply is a follow-up once the key is provisioned\", :content_rating_untouched \"the still-open ADR-2607062200 content-rating decision (free SFW /\\n                            paid may-include-NSFW) is untouched -- this backend serves SFW\\n                            only. A follow-up ADR must decide, if/when the paid tier is\\n                            greenlit, whether to extend this hosted-Sonnet-5 backend or reuse\\n                            club-shinshi's self-fine-tune pipeline for that tier specifically\", :new_deps \"net-babiniku now depends on @anthropic-ai/sdk (npm) and has a Cloudflare Pages\\n            Functions build target (functions/api/) alongside its existing shadow-cljs static\\n            build\", :manual_sync_surface \"the roster/persona/schema duplication between src/babiniku/\\n                        {character,persona}.cljc and functions/api/chat.js is a manual-sync\\n                        surface (3 characters, 2 small enum sets) -- nbb persona/nbb governor are\\n                        the tests to run before changing either side\"}", :adr/authoritative_for ["net-babiniku's SFW chat tier uses a hosted Claude Sonnet 5 call, not a self-fine-tuned/\n    self-hosted model -- club-shinshi's uncensored-model precedent does not apply to this tier" "the Anthropic API call lives only in a Cloudflare Pages Function (functions/api/chat.js),\n    never in browser-shipped .cljs -- the API key must never reach client code" "every chat turn's shape is enforced via Claude structured outputs (output_config.format),\n    with emotion/motion_cue enums drawn directly from babiniku.governor/default-policy -- a\n    schema-conformant reply can only ever fail review-turn on content, never on shape" "the fetched turn always routes through babiniku.governor/review-turn via :governor/propose\n    -- the same gate every pre-existing demo button used; nothing about this feature is a new\n    bypass path" "if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is unprovisioned, the Function returns 503 -- never a crash, never a\n    fabricated turn (honest-default, ADR-0084 pattern)"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "net-babiniku-llm-backend", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2607062200-net-babiniku-onlyfans-style-creator-monetization.md" "90-docs/adr/2607062210-net-babiniku-giemon-humanoid-embodiment-procurement.md" "90-docs/adr/2607062300-jk-luxury-org-club-shinshi-net-babiniku-relocation.md"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607070800-net-babiniku-llm-backend-claude-sonnet-5", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-07", :adr/decision "{:model {:what \"claude-sonnet-5\", :self_fine_tune? false, :self_hosted? false}, :structured_outputs {:what \"every chat turn request sets output_config.format to a json_schema constraining the\\n          reply to {dialogue, emotion, motion_cue}, with emotion/motion_cue enums drawn\\n          directly from babiniku.governor/default-policy's :allowed-emotions/\\n          :allowed-motion-cues -- not a separately maintained list\", :why \"a schema-conformant reply can only ever fail review-turn on CONTENT (a blocked term,\\n        an ambiguous content-tier), never on an emotion/motion-cue the gate doesn't recognize\"}, :call_site {:what \"functions/api/chat.js, a Cloudflare Pages Function -- never the browser\", :why \"net-babiniku deploys as a static site to Cloudflare Pages; ANTHROPIC_API_KEY must\\n        never reach client-shipped code. The Function holds the key as a Cloudflare secret\\n        (not yet provisioned -- see :consequences) and is the only place allowed to call\\n        api.anthropic.com\"}, :official_sdk {:what \"@anthropic-ai/sdk, not raw HTTP against the Messages API\", :why \"the claude-api skill requires the official SDK whenever one exists for the project's\\n        language; Cloudflare Pages Functions (Workers runtime, fetch-based) are SDK-compatible\\n        -- no technical blocker forced raw HTTP here\"}, :persona_schema_source_of_truth {:what \"babiniku.persona (new .cljc namespace) builds the system prompt + structured-output\\n          schema from a babiniku.character roster entry -- pure, nbb-testable, no HTTP.\\n          functions/api/chat.js cannot run Clojure, so it carries a manual, DOCUMENTED mirror\\n          of the roster/persona/schema data\", :precedent \"same duplication call babiniku.vrm-bridge's own docstring already makes: a\\n              whole separate build pipeline isn't worth it for a handful of small, rarely-\\n              changed functions/data\", :test_gate \"nbb persona is the source-of-truth test for the .cljc side; the JS mirror's top\\n              comment names exactly which .cljc files/tests it must stay in sync with\"}, :richer_persona_bios {:what \"each roster character gained :persona-bio/:speech-examples (full backstory + voice\\n          examples, beyond the existing one-line :tagline)\", :why \"(a) improves in-character consistency, and (b) partly caching economics -- cache_\\n        control: ephemeral sits on the system-prompt block, and a terse prompt likely wouldn't\\n        clear Claude's minimum-cacheable-prefix floor, so the richer bio gives the cached\\n        system prompt enough length to actually be cache-eligible across repeated turns\"}, :honest_default {:what \"if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is unset, the Function returns 503 with an explicit 'not yet\\n          provisioned (準備中)' message -- never a crash, never a fabricated reply -- mirroring\\n          babiniku.monetization's UnprovisionedCapability pattern (ADR-0084 precedent)\", :ui_side \"babiniku.ui.events' :chat/error never appends a ledger entry for a failed fetch; a\\n            real turn only reaches the ledger by passing through babiniku.governor/review-turn\\n            via :governor/propose -- the same gate every pre-existing demo button used\"}}", :db/id -1, :adr/problem "{:source \"user direction 2026-07-06/07: pivot to big decisions needing user input,\\n           specifically LLM backend selection -- 'shinshi.clubの前例（自家fine-tune+Modal/\\n           vLLM）を踏襲するか、別のアプローチか。' User chose Claude Sonnet 5 as the model\\n           tier, and chose to implement now.\", :prior_state {:what \"net-babiniku had reached Milestone 2 (governor HARD/SOFT containment, monetization\\n          honest-default, giemon embodiment gate) with NO real chat feature -- every dialogue\\n          'proposal' was a hardcoded demo button (db/default-db's :demo-proposals). No LLM\\n          provider/model had ever been chosen.\"}, :club_shinshi_precedent {:what \"club-shinshi (separate jk-luxury product, now owned by a different agent) self-\\n          fine-tunes + self-hosts (Modal/vLLM, ADR-2606032100) an uncensored model because its\\n          paid tier includes NSFW roleplay a hosted API's classifiers would refuse\", :why_it_does_not_apply \"net-babiniku's chat feature per this ADR is SFW-only -- the still-\\n                          open content-rating decision (ADR-2607062200's paid tier 'may\\n                          include NSFW') is untouched and out of scope here. For SFW-only\\n                          chat, a hosted model with a good system prompt is sufficient; self-\\n                          hosting buys nothing this tier needs.\"}, :model_tiers_considered {:haiku_4_5 {:price \"$1/$5 per MTok\", :pros \"fastest, cheapest, cost/latency-optimal default\", :caveats \"min cacheable prompt is 4096 tokens (a terse persona prompt wouldn't\\n                        clear it); roleplay/persona consistency is a plausible weak point for\\n                        a VTuber product\"}, :sonnet_5 {:price \"$3/$15 per MTok ($2/$10 intro through 2026-08-31)\", :why_chosen \"user's choice -- meaningfully better roleplay/persona consistency,\\n                          cost/latency premium judged acceptable at this feature's current\\n                          scale; supports structured outputs the same as Haiku 4.5 would\"}, :opus_tier {:considered? false, :why \"this is a low-cost real-time chat-turn workload, not a code-authorship\\n                    task where the claude-api skill's default-to-Opus guidance applies -- user\\n                    was asked to choose directly between the two cost-appropriate tiers\"}}}", :adr/alternatives "[{:option \"self-fine-tune + self-host (club-shinshi's precedent)\", :rejected_because \"no NSFW content is in scope for this tier -- the operational complexity\\n                      (GPU hosting, fine-tune data pipeline) buys nothing over a hosted Claude\\n                      model with a good system prompt\"} {:option \"Claude Haiku 4.5\", :rejected_because \"considered as the cost/latency-optimal default; user chose Sonnet 5 for\\n                      better roleplay/persona consistency, judging the cost/latency premium\\n                      acceptable at this product's current scale\"} {:option \"raw HTTP against the Messages API instead of @anthropic-ai/sdk\", :rejected_because \"the claude-api skill requires the official SDK whenever one exists;\\n                      Cloudflare Pages Functions are SDK-compatible, no technical blocker\\n                      forced raw HTTP\"} {:option \"free-text dialogue parsing (regex/heuristics for emotion/motion-cue) instead of\\n            structured outputs\", :rejected_because \"structured outputs let the schema itself enforce babiniku.governor's\\n                      exact vocabulary, eliminating a whole class of unknown-emotion/motion-\\n                      cue HARD-holds caused by imprecise free-text instruction-following\"} {:option \"a shared build artifact (e.g. a shadow-cljs :node-library target) instead of a\\n            manually duplicated JS mirror of the persona/schema logic\", :rejected_because \"coupling the Cloudflare Functions build to the shadow-cljs pipeline for 3\\n                      small character records and two enum lists is more machinery than the\\n                      current scale justifies -- same reasoning babiniku.vrm-bridge's own\\n                      docstring already gives for its own small-glue duplication\"}]", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607070800: net-babiniku LLM chat backend -- Claude Sonnet 5, structured\n          outputs, no self-fine-tune"}]